  "prefLabel": "En 1002.05 Authorization to interconnect",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1002.05 “Authorization to interconnect” means an official written notification provided by the utility to the interconnecting customer, authorizing the applicant to activate and operate the facility subject to the terms of the interconnection agreement or conditional approval of the interconnection agreement, as applicable.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
